pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 36]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: nav-active
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 32, 320, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: nav-text1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [0, 0, 320, 32]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      color: "$lightText"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>项目背景与定位</p>
  - elementId: nav-text2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [320, 0, 320, 32]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      color: "$lightText"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>系统架构设计</p>
  - elementId: nav-text3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 0, 320, 32]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      color: "$accent"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>关键技术亮点</p>
  - elementId: nav-text4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [960, 0, 320, 32]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      color: "$lightText"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>项目成果与展望</p>
  - elementId: pat-accent-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 56, 4, 28]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: pat-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [76, 50, 600, 36]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      fontSize: 28
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>设计模式与技术创新</strong></p>
  - elementId: pat-card1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 360, 240]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
  - elementId: pat-card1-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [80, 130, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:sitemap"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: pat-card1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [122, 128, 280, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>策略模式 + 责任链</strong></p>
  - elementId: pat-card1-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 175, 320, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>API 和 Strategy 模块使用 XxxFilterContext + Map&lt;String, Filter&gt; 注入实现动态校验链，校验顺序可通过 Nacos/Redis 动态配置。</p>
  - elementId: pat-card2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [440, 110, 360, 240]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
  - elementId: pat-card2-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [460, 130, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:bolt"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: pat-card2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [502, 128, 280, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>事件驱动架构</strong></p>
  - elementId: pat-card2-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [460, 175, 320, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>模块间通过 RabbitMQ 解耦，支持 confirm + return 机制保证消息可靠投递，各模块可独立扩缩容。</p>
  - elementId: pat-card3-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [820, 110, 400, 240]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
  - elementId: pat-card3-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [840, 130, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:fingerprint"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: pat-card3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [882, 128, 320, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>雪花算法全局 ID</strong></p>
  - elementId: pat-card3-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [840, 175, 360, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>基于 SnowFlakeUtil 生成全局唯一 sequenceId，支撑分布式环境下的高并发短信发送唯一标识。</p>
  - elementId: pat-card4-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 380, 560, 240]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
  - elementId: pat-card4-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [80, 400, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:filter"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: pat-card4-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [122, 398, 280, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>DFA 敏感词过滤</strong></p>
  - elementId: pat-card4-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 445, 520, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>敏感词过滤使用确定有限自动机（DFA）实现高效匹配，DirtyWordDFAStrategyFilter 在策略链中快速完成敏感词检测，保障短信内容合规。</p>
  - elementId: pat-card5-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 380, 580, 240]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
  - elementId: pat-card5-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [660, 400, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:network-wired"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: pat-card5-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [702, 398, 300, 36]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, alimamashuheiti"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>CMPP 协议 Netty 实现</strong></p>
  - elementId: pat-card5-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 445, 540, 160]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>基于 Netty 自定义编解码器（CMPPEncoder / CMPPDecoder）实现中国移动点对点协议，完成运营商级短信下发：Connect → Submit → Deliver → ActiveTest 心跳。</p>
  - elementId: pat-page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1190, 690, 50, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 12
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>10 / 15</p>
